{"id":1967,"date":"2026-08-25T20:59:06","date_gmt":"2026-08-25T20:59:06","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1967"},"modified":"2026-08-25T21:30:59","modified_gmt":"2026-08-25T21:30:59","slug":"keyboard-shortcuts","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/info-settings\/keyboard-shortcuts\/","title":{"rendered":"Keyboard Shortcuts"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b; font-family: sans-serif;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\" style=\"color: #307870; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-top: 0;\">Keyboard Shortcuts<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1975\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/KeyboardShortcuts.jpg\" alt=\"Keyboard Shortcuts\" width=\"102\" height=\"108\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/KeyboardShortcuts.jpg 870w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/KeyboardShortcuts-284x300.jpg 284w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/KeyboardShortcuts-768x811.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 102px) 100vw, 102px\" \/><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px;\">Open Publisher includes a variety of keyboard shortcuts designed to speed up your desktop publishing workflow, available on both Windows\/Linux and Mac. The shortcuts listed here are also accessible via the <strong>Keyboard Shortcuts Reference<\/strong> panel within the application. <em>Note: Text formatting shortcuts are guarded so they only activate when you are actively editing inside a text box, preventing interference with canvas-level interactions.<\/em><\/p>\n<p><!-- The entire table block is minified onto a single line below to prevent WordPress wpautop issues --><\/p>\n<div style=\"border: 2px solid #307870; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 30px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); padding: 0; background-color: #307870; line-height: 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; border-spacing: 0; border: none; background-color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<thead style=\"background-color: #307870; color: #ffffff;\">\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding: 14px 16px; font-weight: 600; border: none;\">Windows \/ Linux<\/th>\n<th style=\"padding: 14px 16px; font-weight: 600; border: none;\">Mac<\/th>\n<th style=\"padding: 14px 16px; font-weight: 600; border: none;\">Action<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #e5f0ef;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e4d40; border: none;\" colspan=\"3\">File &amp; Document Management<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+S<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+S<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Save document<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+O<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+O<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Open the file explorer to load a document or template<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+P<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+P<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Open the Print dialog \/ Export to PDF<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #e5f0ef;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e4d40; border-left: none; border-right: none;\" colspan=\"3\">Editing &amp; Arrangement<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+Z<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+Z<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Undo last action<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+Y<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+Y<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Redo last undone action<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+C \/ Ctrl+X<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+C \/ Cmd+X<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Copy or Cut selected element<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+V<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+V<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Paste element onto canvas<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+Shift+V<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+Shift+V<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Paste text without formatting<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+A<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+A<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Select All<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+H<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+H<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Find &amp; Replace<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Delete \/ Backspace<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Delete<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Remove selected element from the canvas<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Arrow Keys<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Arrow Keys<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Nudge selected element by 1 pixel for precise alignment<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Shift+Arrow Keys<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Shift+Arrow Keys<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Nudge selected element by 10 pixels<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Shift+Click<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Shift+Click<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Select multiple elements at once<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+Z <span style=\"font-size: 0.85em; font-family: sans-serif; color: #666;\">(in draw mode)<\/span><\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+Z <span style=\"font-size: 0.85em; font-family: sans-serif; color: #666;\">(in draw mode)<\/span><\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Undo Drawing Stroke<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #e5f0ef;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e4d40; border-left: none; border-right: none;\" colspan=\"3\">Text Formatting<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+B<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+B<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Toggle Bold<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+I<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+I<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Toggle Italic<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+U<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+U<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Toggle Underline<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+Space<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+Space<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Clear Formatting \u2014 strips all manual formatting and resets to the default style (Segoe UI, 12px)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Shift+F3<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Shift+F3<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cycle Change Case<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+Shift+K<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+Shift+K<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Toggle Small Caps<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+Shift++<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+Shift++<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Toggle Superscript<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+=<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+=<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Toggle Subscript<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+Shift+&gt;<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+Shift+&gt;<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Increase font size by 1px<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+Shift+&lt;<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+Shift+&lt;<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Decrease font size by 1px<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+Z <span style=\"font-size: 0.85em; font-family: sans-serif; color: #666;\">(in text box)<\/span><\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+Z <span style=\"font-size: 0.85em; font-family: sans-serif; color: #666;\">(in text box)<\/span><\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Undo last text change (keystroke-by-keystroke granularity)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #e5f0ef;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e4d40; border-left: none; border-right: none;\" colspan=\"3\">View &amp; Navigation<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+Mouse Wheel<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+Mouse Wheel<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Zoom slider allows smooth, continuous zoom from 10% all the way to 500%<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Spacebar (Hold)<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Spacebar (Hold)<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Temporarily activates the Pan Tool to drag the canvas<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">F9<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">F9<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Quick Zoom (100%): Toggle between your current zoom level and 100% actual size. Pressing again returns to the previous zoom<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+Shift+L<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+Shift+L<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Whole Page View: Instantly zooms to fit the entire page in the window<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Ctrl+Shift+O<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Cmd+Shift+O<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Toggle Boundaries on\/off (show\/hide element boundary boxes)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e8e6;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Double-click top\/bottom 100px<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Double-click top\/bottom 100px<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none;\">Enter \/ Exit Master Page<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #e5f0ef;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e4d40; border-left: none; border-right: none;\" colspan=\"3\">Miscellaneous<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: none;\">\u2191 \u2191 \u2193 \u2193 \u2190 \u2192 \u2190 \u2192 B A<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; color: #444; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: none;\">\u2191 \u2191 \u2193 \u2193 \u2190 \u2192 \u2190 \u2192 B A<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 16px; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: none;\">Konami Code (Easter Egg)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Keyboard Shortcuts Open Publisher includes a variety of keyboard shortcuts designed to speed up your desktop publishing workflow, available on both Windows\/Linux and Mac. The shortcuts listed here are also accessible via the Keyboard Shortcuts Reference panel within the application. Note: Text formatting shortcuts are guarded so they only activate when you are actively editing [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1975,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[24],"class_list":["post-1967","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-info-settings"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1967","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"hre